OL,3,GNEWSAAttractions still open despite
OL,4,Abluetongue outbreak
OL,5,
OL,6,FSo far this year there have been cases
OL,7,Frecorded of the bluetongue virus (BTV)
OL,8,Fat 556 sites in the UK, including 327
OL,9,Fin Devon and 110 in Cornwall, according
OL,10,Fto latest government figures.
